        <li style="padding:var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);"><strong>1. WhatsApp contact.</strong> Send a photograph of the window with a short description. Reply within one hour on weekdays. Direct line to the owner, not a contact form that disappears into an inbox.</li>
        <li style="padding:var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);"><strong>2. Free digital mockup within 48 hours.</strong> We produce a to-scale mockup showing how the design lands on your actual window. Revisions are unlimited and free.</li>
        <li style="padding:var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);"><strong>3. Production at Rotterdam print partners.</strong> Cut vinyl in-house, full-colour print at our local print partners. A-brand vinyl only. Production lead time is three to four working days.</li>
